{"id":"915b1b40e676c0da","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom.md","title":"固定基础预言机的 n 随机交织定理","display":"thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom — 固定基础预言机的 n 随机交织定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom","aliases":["43-thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom"],"display":"thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom — 固定基础预言机的 n 随机交织定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-nrandom]]","[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]","[[43-thm-vanlambalgen]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.6 Theorems 11.6.2、11.6.5的相对化，印刷262–263，PDF282–283","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom — 固定基础预言机的 n 随机交织定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1a77567a7b7267eb\" href=\"?note=1a77567a7b7267eb\" title=\"43-thm-vanlambalgen\">43-thm-vanlambalgen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.6 Theorems 11.6.2、11.6.5的相对化，印刷262–263，PDF282–283"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；n随机性、相对ML随机性、跳跃、交织见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}\\)</span> 是以集合预言机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" href=\"?note=75e7e3b6eeecc95e\" title=\"43-df-rel-mlrandom\">43-df-rel-mlrandom</a>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Random}_n\\)</span> 是由正整数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 索引的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上布尔谓词族，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"86bdc33f83ee57a9\" href=\"?note=86bdc33f83ee57a9\" title=\"43-df-nrandom\">43-df-nrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Random}_n(X\\oplus Y)\\iff\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{X\\oplus\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Random}_n(X\\oplus Y)\\iff\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{X\\oplus\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将van Lambalgen定理相对化到基础预言机0<sup>(n−1)。明确写出联合预言机，避免将X的(n−1)次跳跃与X⊕0</sup>(n−1)未经证明混同。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.6 Theorems 11.6.2、11.6.5的相对化，印刷262–263，PDF282–283。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-nrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-rel-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"75e7e3b6eeecc95e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1