2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 是以集合预言机 $B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 是以集合预言机 $B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-nrandom","status":"resolved","id":"86bdc33f83ee57a9","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词；$\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}$ 是以集合预言机 $B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 为参数的同域谓词族，相对形式见 [[43-df-rel-mlrandom]]，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。\n$\\mathrm{Random}_n$ 是由正整数 $n$ 索引的 $2^\\omega$ 上布尔谓词族，见 [[43-df-nrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{B}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Random}_n(X\\oplus Y)\\iff\\mathrm{Random}_n(X)\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}^{X\\oplus\\varnothing^{(n-1)}}(Y).","display":true}],"bytes":1750,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-263","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-vanlambalgen-nrandom]] — 固定基础预言机的 n 随机交织定理"}],"outgoing":["86bdc33f83ee57a9","75e7e3b6eeecc95e","b3936ae4c5d2dc79","be1278f108eb178d","1a77567a7b7267eb","0586e0fd0301d605"]}